{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01hd5VrpXEHjLafn5UvSIuRO","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:5\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"6682\">\n    <frame id=\"1:6\" name=\"Header\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"321\">\n      <text id=\"1:7\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"64\" y=\"56\" width=\"1312\" height=\"21\" />\n      <text id=\"1:8\" name=\"Stylish — fashion &amp; lifestyle shopping app\" x=\"64\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"60\" />\n      <text id=\"1:9\" name=\"Design the complete Stylish mobile shopping app: a first-time shopper goes through onboarding, signs in, browses featured deals and trending products, opens a product, reviews the shopping bag, pays and manages the profile. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Home, Product list, Product detail and Profile may scroll vertically. Currency: Indian rupee (₹). Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"64\" y=\"161\" width=\"1312\" height=\"104\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"1:10\" name=\"Body\" x=\"0\" y=\"321\" width=\"1440\" height=\"6361\">\n      <frame id=\"1:11\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"265\">\n        <text id=\"1:12\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1312\" height=\"33\" />\n        <text id=\"1:13\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 15 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / disabled, sale and rating colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, banners, payment logos and icons from 04 · Media. A product marked “no photo supplied” needs a consistent fallback of your choice. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"216\" />\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"1:14\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"377\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3224\">\n        <text id=\"1:15\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1312\" height=\"33\" />\n        <text id=\"1:16\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n        <frame id=\"1:17\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"88\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3136\">\n          <frame id=\"1:18\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"632\" height=\"224\">\n            <text id=\"1:19\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:20\" name=\"Goal: Recognise the brand while the app loads.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:21\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:22\" name=\"• Brand: Stylish logo\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:23\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"151\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:24\" name=\"→ auto-advance → 02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\" x=\"25\" y=\"178\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:25\" name=\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\" x=\"656\" y=\"0\" width=\"632\" height=\"329\">\n            <text id=\"1:26\" name=\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:27\" name=\"Goal: Learn what the app offers (step 1).\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:28\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:29\" name=\"• Actions: Next · Skip • Copy: “Choose Products” · “Browse thousands of products across fashion, beauty, electronics and more.” • Media: Onboarding_Choose_Products • Progress: step 1 of 3\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"105\" />\n            <text id=\"1:30\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"235\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:31\" name=\"→ Next → 03_Onboarding_Make_Payment → Skip → 05_Sign_In\" x=\"25\" y=\"262\" width=\"582\" height=\"42\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:32\" name=\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\" x=\"0\" y=\"353\" width=\"632\" height=\"287\">\n            <text id=\"1:33\" name=\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:34\" name=\"Goal: Learn how paying works (step 2).\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:35\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:36\" name=\"• Actions: Next · Prev · Skip • Copy: “Make Payment” · “Pay securely with your saved cards, PayPal or Apple Pay.” • Media: Onboarding_Make_Payment • Progress: step 2 of 3\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"84\" />\n            <text id=\"1:37\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:38\" name=\"→ Prev → 02 · Next → 04 · Skip → 05_Sign_In\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:39\" name=\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\" x=\"656\" y=\"353\" width=\"632\" height=\"287\">\n            <text id=\"1:40\" name=\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:41\" name=\"Goal: Learn how delivery works (step 3).\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:42\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:43\" name=\"• Actions: Get Started · Prev · Skip • Copy: “Get Your Order” · “Track your order until it arrives at your door.” • Media: Onboarding_Get_Your_Order • Progress: step 3 of 3\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"84\" />\n            <text id=\"1:44\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:45\" name=\"→ Prev → 03 · Get Started → 05_Sign_In · Skip → 05_Sign_In\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:46\" name=\"05_Sign_In\" x=\"0\" y=\"664\" width=\"632\" height=\"329\">\n            <text id=\"1:47\" name=\"05_Sign_In\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:48\" name=\"Goal: Sign in to an existing account.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:49\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:50\" name=\"• Actions: Forgot Password? · Login · “Create An Account” Sign Up • Copy: “Welcome Back!” • Form: Password (can be shown or hidden) · Username or Email · nothing entered yet • Social sign-in: “- OR Continue with -” · Apple · Facebook · Google\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"84\" />\n            <text id=\"1:51\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:52\" name=\