           <text id=\"1:65\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:66\" name=\"→ Submit → 05_Sign_In\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:67\" name=\"08_Get_Started\" x=\"656\" y=\"1038\" width=\"632\" height=\"266\">\n            <text id=\"1:68\" name=\"08_Get_Started\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:69\" name=\"Goal: Enter the store.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:70\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:71\" name=\"• Actions: Get Started • Copy: “You want Authentic, here you go!” · “Find it here, buy it now!” • Media: Get_Started_Photo\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"63\" />\n            <text id=\"1:72\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:73\" name=\"→ Get Started → 09_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:74\" name=\"09_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"1349\" width=\"632\" height=\"539\">\n            <text id=\"1:75\" name=\"09_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:76\" name=\"Goal: Discover deals, categories and trending products.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:77\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:78\" name=\"• Account: avatar · menu entry • Banner: “40–50% OFF” · “Now in all products” · “All colours” · Shop Now · 3 slides · current: slide 2 • Brand: Stylish logo • Categories: Beauty · Fashion · Kids · Mens · Womens · Gifts, each with its image • Deal of the Day: “Deal of the Day” · “22h 55m 20s remaining” · View all · 4 products (DATA) • Featured: “All Featured” · Sort · Filter • Main navigation: current tab Home • Promotions: Special Offers · Flat and Heels · Hot Summer Sale · New Arrivals · Sponsored (DATA) • Search: “Search any Product..” · voice input • Trending Products: “Trending Products” · “Last Date 28/02/22” · View all · 5 products (DATA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"294\" />\n            <text id=\"1:79\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"424\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:80\" name=\"→ Trending Products View all → 10_Product_List → Sponsored → 11_Product_Detail → tabs\" x=\"25\" y=\"451\" width=\"582\" height=\"63\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:81\" name=\"10_Product_List\" x=\"656\" y=\"1349\" width=\"632\" height=\"350\">\n            <text id=\"1:82\" name=\"10_Product_List\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:83\" name=\"Goal: Browse every item in the store.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:84\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:85\" name=\"• Account: avatar · menu entry • Brand: Stylish logo • Main navigation: current tab Home • Products: 14 products, each with image, name, description, price and rating count (DATA) • Results: “52,082+ Items” · Sort · Filter • Search: “Search any Product..” · voice input\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"147\" />\n            <text id=\"1:86\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"277\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:87\" name=\"→ tabs\" x=\"25\" y=\"304\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:88\" name=\"11_Product_Detail\" x=\"0\" y=\"1912\" width=\"632\" height=\"455\">\n            <text id=\"1:89\" name=\"11_Product_Detail\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:90\" name=\"Goal: Judge a product and add it to the bag.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:91\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:92\" name=\"• Actions: back · cart entry · Go to cart · Buy Now · View Similar · Add to Compare • Delivery: “Delivery within 1 hour” • Gallery: 5 photos (Nike_Sneakers_1–5) · current: photo 1 • Main navigation: current tab Home • Policies: Nearest Store · VIP · Return policy • Price: ₹1,500 · was ₹2,999 · 50% Off • Product: “Nike Sneakers” · “Vision Alta Men’s Shoes Size (All Colours)” · rating count 56,890 · “Product Details” with its text and “More” • Similar: “Similar To” · “282+ Items” · Sort · Filter · 4 products (DATA) • Size: 6 UK / 7 UK / 8 UK / 9 UK / 10 UK · current: 7 UK (“Size: 7 UK”)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"210\" />\n            <text id=\"1:93\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"340\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:94\" name=\"→ back → 09_Home → Go to cart → 12_Shopping_Bag → tabs\" x=\"25\" y=\"367\" width=\"582\" height=\"63\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:95\" name=\"12_Shopping_Bag\" x=\"656\" y=\"1912\" width=\"632\" height=\"392\">\n            <text id=\"1:96\" name=\"12_Shopping_Bag\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:97\" name=\"Goal: Review the bag before paying.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:98\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:99\" name=\"• Actions: back · wishlist entry · Apply Coupons “Select” · Proceed to Payment · View Details • Copy: “Shopping Bag” • Item: Women’s Casual Wear · photo · Size 42 (changeable) · Qty 1 (changeable) · “Delivery by 10 May” • Order Payment Details: Order Amounts ₹7,000.00 · Convenience: Know More · Apply Coupon · Delivery Fee ₹30.00 · Order Total ₹7,030.00 · EMI Available · Details • Total: ₹7,030.00\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"168\" />\n            <text id=\"1:100\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:101\" name=\"→ back → 11_Product_Detail → Proceed to Payment → 13_Payment\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"582\" height=\"42\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:102\" name=\"13_Payment\" x=\"0\" y=\"2391\" width=\"632\" height=\"371\">\n            <text id=\"1:103\" name=\"13_Payment\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:104\" name=\"Goal: Choose how to pay and confirm.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:105\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:106\" name=\"• Actions: back · Continue • Copy: “Checkout” · “Payment” • Main navigation: current tab Cart • Payment methods: VISA · PayPal · Maestro · Apple Pay, each “*********2109” · only one can be chosen · current: VISA • Summary: Order ₹7,000 · Shipping ₹30 · Total ₹7,030\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"126\" />\n            <text id=\"1:107\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:108\" name=\"→ back → 12_Shopping_Bag → Continue → 14_Payment_Success_Overlay → tabs\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"582\" height=\"63\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:109\" name=\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\" x=\"656\" y=\"2391\" width=\"632\" height=\"266\">\n            <text id=\"1:110\" name=\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:111\" name=\"Goal: Know the payment went through.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:112\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:113\" name=\"• Copy: “Payment done successfully.” • Presentation: dialog over 13_Payment; Payment stays behind it • Status: success mark\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"63\" />\n            <text id=\"1:114\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:115\" name=\"→ tap dialog → 09_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:116\" name=\"15_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"2786\" width=\"632\" height=\"350\">\n            <text id=\"1:117\" name=\"15_Profile\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"582\" height=\"27\" />\n            <text id=\"1:118\" name=\"Goal: Review and edit account details.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n            <text id=\"1:119\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:120\" name=\"• Account: avatar · edit avatar • Actions: back · Change Password · Save • Bank Account Details: Bank Account Number · Account Holder’s Name · IFSC Code (DATA) • Business Address Details: Postcode · Address · City · State · Country (DATA) • Copy: “Profile” • Personal Details: Email Address aashifa@gmail.com · Password (masked)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"582\" height=\"147\" />\n            <text id=\"1:121\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"277\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n            <text id=\"1:122\" name=\"→ back → 09_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"304\" width=\"582\" height=\"21\" />\n          </frame>\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"1:123\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"3649\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <text id=\"1:124\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1312\" height=\"33\" />\n        <text id=\"1:125\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01 → 02 → 03 → 04 → 05_Sign_In; Skip on 02–04 goes straight to 05. • Account: 05_Sign_In ↔ 06_Sign_Up; 05 → 07_Forgot_Password → 05. Login / Create Account → 08_Get_Started → 09_Home. • Main navigation on 09, 10, 11, 13 — five tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 09 · Wishlist (Icon_Wishlist, entry only) · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 12_Shopping_Bag · Search (Icon_Search, entry only) · Setting (Icon_Settings) → 15_Profile. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Purchase: 09 → 11_Product_Detail → 12_Shopping_Bag → 13_Payment → 14 (dialog over 13) → 09. • Entry only (no screen required): menu, Sort, Filter, voice input, Shop Now, View all on Deal of the Day / New Arrivals, Visit now, Buy Now, View Similar, Add to Compare, Apply Coupons, Know More, EMI Details, Change Password, Save, social sign-in. • Do not add frames beyond the 15.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"192\" />\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"1:126\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"3938\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1675\">\n        <text id=\"1:127\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1312\" height=\"33\" />\n        <text id=\"1:128\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Counts use Indian digit grouping (1,52,344). “was” = original price shown struck through or otherwise marked as former price — how is yours.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n        <frame id=\"1:129\" name=\"Data cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"88\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1587\">\n          <frame id=\"1:130\" name=\"User &amp; account\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"632\" height=\"136\">\n            <text id=\"1:131\" name=\"User &amp; account\" x=\"21\" y=\"21\" width=\"590\" height=\"23\" />\n            <text id=\"1:132\" name=\"Aashifa · aashifa@gmail.com · password masked · avatar = Avatar_Illustrated Sign in / Sign up fields: “Username or Email”, “Password”, “Confirm Password” (placeholders, nothing entered)\" x=\"21\" y=\"52\" width=\"590\" height=\"63\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:133\" name=\"Categories (Home)\" x=\"656\" y=\"0\" width=\"632\" height=\"115\">\n            <text id=\"1:134\" name=\"Categories (Home)\" x=\"21\" y=\"21\" width=\"590\" height=\"23\" />\n            <text id=\"1:135\" name=\"Beauty (Category_Beauty) · Fashion (Category_Fashion) · Kids (Category_Kids) · Mens (Category_Mens) · Womens (Category_Womens) · Gifts (Category_Gifts)\" x=\"21\" y=\"52\" width=\"590\" height=\"42\" />\n       