_Sign_In ↔ 06_Sign_Up; 05 → 07_Forgot_Password → 05. Login / Create Account → 08_Get_Started → 09_Home. • Main navigation on 09, 10, 11, 13 — five tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 09 · Wishlist (Icon_Wishlist, entry only) · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 12_Shopping_Bag · Search (Icon_Search, entry only) · Setting (Icon_Settings) → 15_Profile. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Purchase: 09 → 11_Product_Detail → 12_Shopping_Bag → 13_Payment → 14 (dialog over 13) → 09. • Entry only (no screen required): menu, Sort, Filter, voice input, Shop Now, View all on Deal of the Day / New Arrivals, Visit now, Buy Now, View Similar, Add to Compare, Apply Coupons, Know More, EMI Details, Change Password, Save, social sign-in. • Do not add frames beyond the 15.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"192\" />\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"1:126\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"3938\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1675\">\n        <text id=\"1:127\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1312\" height=\"33\" />\n        <text id=\"1:128\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Counts use Indian digit grouping (1,52,344). “was” = original price shown struck through or otherwise marked as former price — how is yours.\" x=\"0\" y=\"49\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n        <frame id=\"1:129\" name=\"Data cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"88\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1587\">\n          <frame id=\"1:130\" name=\"User &amp; account\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"632\" height=\"136\">\n            <text id=\"1:131\" name=\"User &amp; account\" x=\"21\" y=\"21\" width=\"590\" height=\"23\" />\n            <text id=\"1:132\" name=\"Aashifa · aashifa@gmail.com · password masked · avatar = Avatar_Illustrated Sign in / Sign up fields: “Username or Email”, “Password”, “Confirm Password” (placeholders, nothing entered)\" x=\"21\" y=\"52\" width=\"590\" height=\"63\" />\n          </frame>\n          <frame id=\"1:133\" name=\"Categories (Home)\" x=\"656\" y=\"0